  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/liq/506",
  "definition": "Specialty Beverages",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-10-13",
  "historyNote": "#13461, eff 10-13-22",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
  "notation": "Liq 506.20",
  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html",
  "prefLabel": "Liq 506.20 Specialty Beverages",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 506.20 Specialty Beverages.\n\n(a) Beverage manufacturers and Beverage vendors shall complete and submit to the commission the required information on Forms 259 “Monthly Report of Sales of Specialty Beverages to Wholesalers within the State of New Hampshire” (revised 09/2022) and 335 “Monthly Record of Returns of Specialty Beverages by N.H. Wholesalers to Beverage Vendors and Beverage Manufacturers” (revised 09/2022) showing sales and returns of specialty beverage to a wholesale distributor by the 10th of the following month regardless of activity.\n\n(b) Wholesale distributors, beverage manufacturers, and beverage vendors shall invoice specialty beverages on a separate invoice and not include any other beverages.\n\nSource. #13461, eff 10-13-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
